{"title":"Profusion Expo - WTPG booth","startsAt":"2026-11-11T11:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-12T17:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"ProFusion 2026, Canada’s largest Photo, Video & Cinema Industry Event Welcome all current and future creators and industry trailblazers! Save the date because ProFusion Expo 2026 is about to take over the Metro Toronto Convention Centre on November 11th and 12th!\n\n## Time & Location\n\nNov 11, 2026, 11:00 AM – Nov 12, 2026, 3:10 PM\nToronto, 255 Front St W, Toronto, ON M5V 2W6, Canada\n\n## About the event\n\nWest Toronto Photography Group is proud to announce we will be at ProFusion 2026, Canada’s largest Photo, Video & Cinema Industry Event. We are starting this rsvp list so we can send out information and timing for out booth workshops and contests at the event.\nTo get tickets to ProFusion 2026 follow this link go to [http://www.profusionexpo.com](http://www.profusionexpo.com/) to check out the event website!\n\nWelcome all current and future creators and industry trailblazers! Save the date because ProFusion Expo 2026 is about to take over the Metro Toronto Convention Centre on November 11th and 12th!ProFusion 2026 is not just another expo—it's THE place to be for two days; jampacked with the latest gear, engaging seminars and all things you need to succeed in this fast-paced world of professional imaging. Whether you're a seasoned vlogger, a tech-savvy content creator, or an industry pro itching to dive into the latest gear, ProFusion is where we all come together, so lock in those dates and gear up for an epic experience. Join us for Canada's ultimate gathering of imaging pros and up-and-coming enthusiasts. It's all about sharing our passion for imaging and getting hands-on with the gear that brings our vision to life.After more than a decade of incredible success, we intend to make this the best one yet. Don't miss out on joining us at ProFusion Expo 2025 !ProFusion Expo 2026 Dates and HoursWednesday, November 11, 2025 – 11:00 a.m. – 7:00 p.m. EST Thursday, November 12, 2025 – 10:00 a.m. – 5:00 p.m. ESTMetro Toronto Convention Centre, 255 Front Street West – Hall B – North BuildingVisit [http://www.profusionexpo.com](http://www.profusionexpo.com/) for full show details or follow us on social for updates as we get closer to the show.Please note: this is a cashless event.","venue":{"name":"Metro Toronto Convention Centre","address":"255 Front St W, Toronto","lat":43.64379,"lng":-79.38667,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"The Toronto Photography Group","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/5/2/6/6/highres_535761094.jpeg"}